  "prompt": "For each of products 1 to 20 (product_id from 1 to 20, both included) and each week starting from 6 January to 23 June 2025 (week_start, both days included), show the units sold that week and the 4-week moving average of units: the average of that week and the 3 weeks before it, rounded to 2 decimals. weekly_units holds a row for every product and week, with 0 when nothing sold. Within each product, weeks follow each other by week_start. Only weeks in that range count, so a product's first three weeks have fewer than 4 weeks to average: show how many weeks each average covers in weeks_in_window. Return five columns, in this order: product_id, week_start, units, avg_units_4w and weeks_in_window. Return one row for each such product and week. Any row order is fine.",
